"built qubes-specific dependencies from ``{yum,deb}.qubes-os.org``. This is "
"especially true for ``gcc``, which takes several hours to build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/building/qubes-builder.rst:221
#: ca44c0cf96f84bec839bdaa78d3051a6
